     option, as well as a list of protected terms.
     (Dan Rosher via hossman)

@@ -200,6 +200,8 @@ Bug Fixes

 22. SOLR-897: Fixed Argument list too long error when there are lots of snapshots/backups (Dan Rosher via billa)

